## Required columns

url
label

## Labels

0 = legitimate
1 = phishing

## Dataset documentation

Record:
- Dataset source: Kaggle (Malicious URLs Dataset / PhishTank aggregation)
- Dataset URL/reference: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/sid321axn/malicious-urls-dataset
- Collection date: Retrieved for AI Phishing Detection project baseline (2026)
- Number of samples: 30,000 total subset samples (example partitioning)
- Class distribution: ~66% Legitimate (Label 0), ~34% Phishing/Malicious (Label 1)
- License: Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL)
- Preprocessing performed: Filtered raw multi-class logs down to binary labels (benign/legitimate = 0, phishing = 1). The dataset was split into 25,000 samples for model training and 5,000 samples isolated for testing evaluation.

